# A simple asynchronous music synthesizer.
# No loops. No variables. Just sound flowing through hardware.

make a neuron named kick_drum with threshold 10 and leak 5
make a neuron named snare_drum with threshold 15 and leak 3
make a neuron named master_output with threshold 20 and leak 1

# The player hits a key, putting energy into the system
put midi_kick_trigger into the input of kick_drum
put midi_snare_trigger into the input of snare_drum

# Separate the drum signals so they can be processed individually
separate the spike from kick_drum into effect_a and effect_b
separate the spike from snare_drum into effect_c and effect_d

# Combine them back together into the master output
combine the spike from effect_a and effect_c into the input of master_output

start the system
